  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1
    m_Localized: Welcome to Breath Island.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2
    m_Localized: 'Language: English'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3
    m_Localized: Saved to slot {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4
    m_Localized: Loaded slot {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5
    m_Localized: You are out of bait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6
    m_Localized: The line snapped. Only the bait was lost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7
    m_Localized: A {0} took the bait!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8
    m_Localized: Predator! Watch the signal and dodge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9
    m_Localized: The tail strike hit you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10
    m_Localized: You washed ashore and lost one bait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11
    m_Localized: Received {0} shell coins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12
    m_Localized: Added to the aquarium display.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13
    m_Localized: Received {0} materials.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14
    m_Localized: The field guide has been updated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15
    m_Localized: You rolled clear of the spray.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16
    m_Localized: The net slowed it down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17
    m_Localized: The calming pulse weakened it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18
    m_Localized: Not enough coins for a gift.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19
    m_Localized: Friendship increased.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20
    m_Localized: Not enough upgrade materials.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21
    m_Localized: The facility has grown.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22
    m_Localized: The small boat is ready!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23
    m_Localized: E  Talk to {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24
    m_Localized: Common
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25
    m_Localized: Uncommon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26
    m_Localized: Rare
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27
    m_Localized: Predator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28
    m_Localized: 'BREATH ISLAND

      Quiet coastal village'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29
    m_Localized: TIME
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30
    m_Localized: F / SPACE  Start fishing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31
    m_Localized: "WASD Move \xB7 Mouse Look \xB7 E Talk\nM Village \xB7 TAB Guide
      \xB7 L Language"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32
    m_Localized: Hide help
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33
    m_Localized: "FIRST-PERSON \xB7 SUNNY SHORE"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34
    m_Localized: Gentle ripples
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35
    m_Localized: Cast when a fish shadow passes through the water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36
    m_Localized: CAST LINE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37
    m_Localized: "Waiting for a bite\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38
    m_Localized: Watch the movement of the water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39
    m_Localized: REEL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40
    m_Localized: TENSION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41
    m_Localized: S  EASE LINE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 42
    m_Localized: SPACE  REEL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43
    m_Localized: The line snapped
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44
    m_Localized: It is okay. You only lost one bait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45
    m_Localized: TRY AGAIN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46
    m_Localized: NEW DISCOVERY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47
    m_Localized: SELL  +{0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48
    m_Localized: RECORD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49
    m_Localized: DISPLAY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50
    m_Localized: MATERIAL  +{0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51
    m_Localized: "PREDATOR \xB7 BREAKER SHARK"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52
    m_Localized: HEALTH
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53
    m_Localized: NEXT ATTACK {0:0}%
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 54
    m_Localized: 1  DODGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55
    m_Localized: 2  NET
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56
    m_Localized: 3  CALM PULSE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57
    m_Localized: GIFT  12 COINS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58
    m_Localized: KEEP TALKING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59
    m_Localized: VILLAGE GROWTH
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 60
    m_Localized: Restore either facility first. Every choice can be completed later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61
    m_Localized: CLOSE  ESC
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62
    m_Localized: Unlocks a small boat and the reef route.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63
    m_Localized: Displays creatures and brings villagers back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64
    m_Localized: 'RESTORE  '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65
    m_Localized: RESTORATION COMPLETE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 66
    m_Localized: FIELD GUIDE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67
    m_Localized: DISCOVERED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 68
    m_Localized: UNDISCOVERED CREATURE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69
    m_Localized: Watch the ripples and time of day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70
    m_Localized: ON SHOW
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 71
    m_Localized: TAKE A BREATH
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72
    m_Localized: CONTINUE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73
    m_Localized: SAVE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74
    m_Localized: LOAD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75
    m_Localized: "LANGUAGE / \uD55C\uAD6D\uC5B4"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76
    m_Localized: QUIT GAME
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77
    m_Localized: "{0}  \xB7  LEVEL {1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 78
    m_Localized: No bites now. Cast again to check the next hour.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79
    m_Localized: Glimmer Anchovy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80
    m_Localized: A small fish that follows sunlit ripples.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 81
    m_Localized: Cloud Puffer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 82
    m_Localized: It puffs up like a tiny cloud.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83
    m_Localized: Coral Butterfly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84
    m_Localized: A gentle fish that circles shallow coral.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85
    m_Localized: Moon Ray
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86
    m_Localized: It leaves a blue trail across evening water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87
    m_Localized: Pearl Seahorse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88
    m_Localized: A rare creature hiding among sea grass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89
    m_Localized: Breaker Shark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90
    m_Localized: An open-sea predator that cuts through rough waves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91
    m_Localized: Wind Boatyard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92
    m_Localized: Tide Aquarium
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93
    m_Localized: Nari
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94
    m_Localized: Boatwright
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95
    m_Localized: The sea likes people who know how to wait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96
    m_Localized: Repair the boatyard and we can reach the reef.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97
    m_Localized: The waves are gentle today. Listen to your line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 98
    m_Localized: Maru
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 99
    m_Localized: Aquarium Keeper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100
    m_Localized: Record every creature you meet for the first time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101
    m_Localized: A brighter aquarium will bring people back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102
    m_Localized: Cloud puffers are round, but very brave.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
